    alt: "Score every pair: query dot key. Big dot products would shove softmax into regions where gradients vanish, so the paper divides by root d-k first \u2014 a one-character fix that keeps training stable. Softmax turns scores into weights; the weights mix the values. That\u2019s the whole mechanism."
